```openui lifecycle=ephemeral id=closure-example revision=0
root = LearningSurface([explanation], "Worked example", "", "ephemeral")
explanation = Explanation("function outer() {
  let count = 0;
  return function inner() {
    count++;
    return count;
  };
}

const counter = outer();
counter(); // 1
counter(); // 2

After outer() returns, the variable count survives because inner still refers to it. That is the closure.", "Closure example")
